WEBVTT

00:19:26.621 --> 00:19:30.954
in that, and how we sort of make these
very difficult global governance systems.

00:19:31.329 --> 00:19:36.746
My personal belief is that we should have
pretty broad rules about what these

00:19:36.746 --> 00:19:41.079
systems will never do and will always do.

00:19:41.413 --> 00:19:43.746
But then the individual user should get

00:19:43.746 --> 00:19:46.288
a system that kind of behaves
like they want.

00:19:46.871 --> 00:19:50.954
And there will be people do have
very different value systems.

00:19:51.121 --> 00:19:53.288
Some of them are just fundamentally
incompatible.

00:19:53.454 --> 00:19:56.663
No one gets to use eye to, like, exploit
other people, for example,

00:19:56.663 --> 00:20:00.288
and hopefully we can all agree on.
But do you want the AI to like.